WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.040
Marines are without a doubt one of the single most&nbsp;
powerful groups of fighters in all of One Piece,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:09.300
so we are going to rank the fifteen ABSOLUTE&nbsp;
strongest marines in the entire story.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.060
And we cannot make this list without including&nbsp;
the very first person to ever truly defeat Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:20.160
on his quest to become pirate king. This&nbsp;
chain-smoking, fiercely loyal marine is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.720
Vice-Admiral Smoker, who was always set up&nbsp;
as Luffy’s main marine rival from the very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.740
start of the story. And besides effortlessly&nbsp;
overpowering Luffy at the start of the story,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:34.080
he has grown strong enough to even fight on equal&nbsp;
footing with a Warlord of the Sea. And you know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:38.880
what's even cooler? Smoker's smoke devil fruit&nbsp;
powers were the very first logia abilities we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:44.640
ever came across. Plus, I CANNOT imagine that&nbsp;
he is done climbing the ranks of the marines,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:49.320
because after Enies Lobby he basically just&nbsp;
decided it was time to stop messing around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:55.380
and soon after he was promoted to Vice-Admiral.&nbsp;
Which is one of the reasons I'm totally convinced&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.380 --> 00:01:00.660
that by the end of this crazy story, he'll be one&nbsp;
of the strongest new generation marines around.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:07.200
However, while Smoker is on the rise, he still&nbsp;
pales in comparison to the jaw-dropping feat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:12.060
of Vice-Captain Tsuru. And that’s because&nbsp;
Tsuru is simply a legend in the marines&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:18.120
whose reputation is on par with some of the&nbsp;
strongest marines, like those who are coming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:22.920
up at the top of this list. In fact, she is&nbsp;
so well respected that even the foul-mouthed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:28.740
Doflamingo cannot help show her courtesy. And&nbsp;
while her Wash devil fruit isn’t the strongest,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:34.020
she is ABSOLUTELY one of the most extraordinary&nbsp;
tacticians in the entire marines, and she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:38.880
undoubtedly played a pivotal role in developing&nbsp;
the battle plan during the epic war at Marineford.

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:43.860
And I cannot wait to talk all about&nbsp;
the insane marine fighters who took&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.860 --> 00:02:57.360
part in the war, but before that we have the&nbsp;
self-proclaimed best defender in the world,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:02.580
Sentomaru. This sumo-inspired character&nbsp;
is the ultimate bodyguard of the world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:06.540
government’s genius scientist, Dr.&nbsp;
Vegapunk. He is an amazingly powerful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:10.920
fighter who even showed off the first use&nbsp;
of advanced armament haki in the story,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:18.120
but you know what’s even crazier? His true power&nbsp;
lies as the commander of the Marines science unit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:24.420
which includes the cyborg Pacifistas and the&nbsp;
genetically enhanced Seraphim clone. Seriously,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:31.080
anyone who can control these mind-blowing&nbsp;
powers can basically win wars all on their own.

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:35.580
However, while Sentomaru eventually got&nbsp;
washed by these relentless government agents,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:40.980
this next marine put up a way tougher fight&nbsp;
against these masked enemies. And for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:46.740
longest time we didn’t even know that Diez Drake&nbsp;
– aka X Drake – was a marine. That’s because he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:52.260
was actually an undercover captain working for&nbsp;
the secret marine organization: Sword. And let&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:59.460
me tell you, this man is an absolute monster who&nbsp;
became a world famous pirate equal to pre-time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:04.920
skip Luffy. He is an incredible fighter who dual&nbsp;
wields this impressive ax and sword and can also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:11.460
turn into this enormously powerful dinosaur with&nbsp;
his Allosaurus devil fruit. And to top it off,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:16.980
he got so strong that he became one&nbsp;
of Yonko Kaido’s top officers before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:21.060
flipping sides and helping turn the tide of&nbsp;
the battle during the raid on Onigashima.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:25.740
But Drake isn’t even the strongest secret&nbsp;
marine in Sword, and that’s because at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:29.520
number eleven we have the character who&nbsp;
might very well be the strongest marine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:34.920
ever by the time he reaches his full power.&nbsp;
That’s right, this right here is the future&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:39.840
fleet admiral. But if I’m being honest, while&nbsp;
Koby started out as a pretty pitiful weakingly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:46.620
his growth rate in the story is simply RIDICULOUS.&nbsp;
I mean he went from being this crying little kid&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:51.720
to an absolute chad in just a few years and&nbsp;
at this point can even stand up to Yonko like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:56.580
Blackbeard without backing down And while he&nbsp;
doesn’t have a devil fruit, he is a master of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.580 --> 00:05:04.860
observation haki and I wouldn’t be surprised if&nbsp;
he eventually becomes the strongest Marine ever.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:10.380
However, he’ll have to wait to climb the marine&nbsp;
ranks, which is also the sad fate for these two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:15.660
marines right here. And you may have even&nbsp;
forgotten that Gion and Tokikake exist,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:18.600
and we certainly don’t have&nbsp;
any impressive feats for them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:24.780
but these two vice admirals were specifically&nbsp;
mentioned as candidates to take the two vacant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:32.340
admirals spots during the time skip. Which means&nbsp;
they must be incredibly strong if they barely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.340 --> 00:05:37.620
missed the cut to be considered on the same&nbsp;
level as these next marines in the ranking.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:43.080
Which brings us to the incredibly hyped admiral&nbsp;
tier, which has ALWAYS been portrayed as absurdly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:47.760
more powerful than your everyday marines. But&nbsp;
at the bottom of admirals’ tier is the meme,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:53.580
the myth, the legend, Admiral Greenbull. Even&nbsp;
though he is constantly made fun of for being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.580 --> 00:06:01.080
scared of Shanks and being an Akainu fanboy, he is&nbsp;
undoubtedly powerful with his forest Logia powers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:07.740
which he can use to grow deadly vines and giant&nbsp;
forests in the blink of an eye. In fact, he even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:13.680
took on the entire guardians of Wano and easily&nbsp;
fought the commanders of the Revolutionary Army.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:18.600
And the man fighting right beside him – or&nbsp;
ironically, sometimes against him – in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:23.460
clash with the revolutionaries is the blind&nbsp;
admiral Fujitora. But don’t be fooled by his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:28.920
disability because this man will straight up&nbsp;
drop a meteor on your head with his gravity&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:36.780
devil fruit powers. And this devil fruit power&nbsp;
is truly op, which is why it barely missed the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:42.300
cut for my top 5 devil fruits ranking. For&nbsp;
example, Fujitora can use its powers to fly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:49.200
effortlessly crush opponents, lift giant heaps&nbsp;
of rubble, and combine gravity with his sword to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:55.560
create devastating attacks. Plus his observation&nbsp;
haki is SO strong that he can basically see by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.560 --> 00:07:00.300
sensing the people around him. However, his&nbsp;
strength isn’t even the most important part of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:05.760
his character because Fujitora is also a man on a&nbsp;
mission to rid the marines and world government of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.760 --> 00:07:11.520
corruption. He frequently disobeys orders that he&nbsp;
doesn’t think are good and even desperately worked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:16.740
to disband the entire Warlord system after he saw&nbsp;
what Doflamingo did to the country of Dressrosa.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:21.420
And unlike the next marine on this list, if you&nbsp;
want to stay free of world government corruption&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:25.260
make sure to subscribe to the channel for&nbsp;
more one piece content just like this.

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:31.200
Unfortunately for this former marine admiral, he&nbsp;
never had that opportunity, because he left the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:38.100
marines after his crew was completely wiped out&nbsp;
and the government didn’t care at all. And while&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:44.640
Zephyr never officially appears in the manga,&nbsp;
he is the main antagonist of Film Z, although&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:50.820
it is basically confirmed that his backstory is&nbsp;
canon. That’s because during his time as a marine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:55.680
he became a famous trainer who brought along the&nbsp;
many of the marine prodigies still to come on this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.680 --> 00:08:02.880
list. And with everything we see in the film, he&nbsp;
certainly is a devastatingly powerful fighter on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:09.360
par with many of the legendary older generation&nbsp;
of marines. Zephyr mainly brawls with his fists,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:15.480
including his super destructive mechanical arm,&nbsp;
and is a master of haki and Rokushiki techniques.

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:21.960
Though even this overpowered master eventually&nbsp;
got taken out by his student because admiral&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:27.480
Kizaru showed up at the end of Film Z and wiped&nbsp;
out his former teacher. But don’t feel bad for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:32.160
Zephyr because Kizaru is a true weapon&nbsp;
of destruction who might actually own the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:38.100
title of defeating the most pirates in the&nbsp;
entire story. The light fruit user can kick&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:43.800
at light speed and shoot out incredibly powerful&nbsp;
beams of light which he used to almost take out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:49.920
the entire worst generation of pirates on Sabaody.&nbsp;
And honestly I would love to have even a fraction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:55.620
of this man’s confidence because he straight up&nbsp;
wanted to go to Wano to take care of Big Mom and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.620 --> 00:09:03.840
Wano BY HIMSELF. What a madman. He is also the&nbsp;
only marine to remain an admiral both before and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:09.300
after the timeskip and is undoubtedly going to&nbsp;
play a major role in the future of the story.

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:18.660
Which is precisely what we hope for Kong,&nbsp;
who could either be the strongest marine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:24.900
in history or just some random dude who loves&nbsp;
his oversized fish tanks And while that second&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:33.060
option is highly unlikely, I mean COME. ON. Can&nbsp;
we get any remarkable feats for this man? I even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.060 --> 00:09:37.560
considered putting him much lower in my ranking&nbsp;
because even I sometimes forget about this dude&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:44.760
because he has done literally nothing in the&nbsp;
story despite his impressive resume. What we do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:50.760
know is that he is the current World Government&nbsp;
Commander in Chief, who has complete control of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:56.460
both the Marines and Chepier Pol agencies. Plus&nbsp;
he was the fleet admiral during Roger’s era,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.460 --> 00:10:01.320
so we should expect him to be strong since the&nbsp;
Fleet admiral is promoted from the admirals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:06.180
and you only get to that point by being&nbsp;
super strong. I mean also, he’s one of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:12.240
buffest dudes in the story, but that clout can&nbsp;
only take him so far. But maybe the only time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:17.460
we ever saw Kong get pissed was when the next&nbsp;
marine on this list turned in his resignation.

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:22.080
And it may surprise you that I&nbsp;
have ranked Sengoku over Kong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:27.420
but in my opinion Sengoku has always been&nbsp;
massively underrated just because he gets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:32.040
overshadowed by the number one figure&nbsp;
on this list. But this afro man was the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:36.480
former fleet admiral, he fought against&nbsp;
Whitebeard and Roger in their primes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:41.280
he is a great tactician who was smart enough to&nbsp;
out maneuver Whitebeard during Marineford. Plus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:46.980
he has the Golden Buddah devil fruit which can&nbsp;
send out giant shockwaves and has always stood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:52.440
out to me as something that might have some super&nbsp;
secret powers we have yet to see in the story.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:56.760
Which I know that’s kinda hard to believe,&nbsp;
but you will probably be even more shocked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.760 --> 00:11:02.700
by who is ranked above Sengoku on this&nbsp;
list. That’s because next up is Aokiji,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:07.680
the ice logia fruit user. And while he may&nbsp;
not be a marine anymore after joining the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:12.480
Blackbeard pirates, we just have to include him&nbsp;
because of the possibility that he is working&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:19.080
undercover. And this man is an absolute god.&nbsp;
His devil fruit powers are so OP that he nearly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:23.820
wiped out the straw hat crew after Skypiea,&nbsp;
he can easily fight on par with the Yonko,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:28.980
and even a super powerful character like&nbsp;
Doflamingo didn’t want to mess with him.

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:33.900
But what’s most impressive is that he&nbsp;
fought for TEN WHOLE DAYS against Akainu,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:39.720
who is our next strongest marine in my ranking.&nbsp;
And this epic clash of ice and Akainu’s magma,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:45.300
these two literally changed the terrain of an&nbsp;
entire island. However, Akainu eventually won&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:49.920
this legendary clash, so we just have to rank&nbsp;
him slightly higher. And it is fully deserved&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:55.140
as he has what the author called one of the&nbsp;
most destructive powers in the entire story&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:55.140 --> 00:12:01.080
with the magma devil fruit. I mean this power is&nbsp;
so strong that Akainu could literally punch off&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:07.020
half of Whitebeard’s head. Along with a ton of&nbsp;
other impressive accomplishments, Akainu is the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:12.360
current fleet admiral and just HAS TO BE one of&nbsp;
the final antagonists for the end of the story.

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:19.260
Which is insane that there is another even more&nbsp;
powerful marine, but I simply could not rank this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:25.320
one any lower. He was the rival of Gol D. Roger,&nbsp;
took out Rocks D. Xebec, and even wanted to kill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:30.660
Akainu himself during the war at Marineford.&nbsp;
I’m of course talking about Monkey D. Garp.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:37.320
And we see just how insanely powerful he is&nbsp;
in recent chapters when this old Garp - who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:43.440
is not even in his prime anymore - basically&nbsp;
wiped out half a Yonko’s crew plus an admiral&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:48.780
level character by himself and used his advanced&nbsp;
conqueror’s haki to destroy this entire town with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:53.040
a single punch. But while this particular&nbsp;
moment showed off Garp’s ridiculous power,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:58.440
it still didn’t make my list of top thirteen&nbsp;
conquerors haki moments in the story. But if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:03.720
you want to see which legendary moments did make&nbsp;
the list, you can watch that video right here.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:06.660
Shanks for watching and I’ll&nbsp;
see you in the next one.

